  "final_message": "Implemented exact simultaneous integer updates with precomputed wall reflections.\n\n- **Rust:** contiguous double buffers and AVX2 vectorization, with a portable fallback.\n- **plain.py:** packed 17-bit cells using Python\u2019s arbitrary-precision integers.\n- **fast.py:** reusable NumPy buffers with in-place vector operations.\n\nAll three pass **s1, s2, and s3 byte-for-byte**, plus 209 reference checks. Benchmark-sized outputs agree. Rust builds successfully with `cargo build --release --offline`.",
